      "content": "I understand the proprietary nature of the specific data, but I need a more generalized framework for the SOP so we can build out our internal protocols. Can you provide a breakdown of the standard hardware and monitoring requirements? Like, what specific equipment is typically used for temperature logging, the types of insulated containers, and what kind of contingency protocols are standard if a shipment is delayed at customs or in transit?",
